# Environment. The settings for running from source live in deploy/ as <app>.env, copied from the
# committed <app>.env.example beside them - so the names are ignored by shape, not by being called
# `.env`, and an example is exempt.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
!*.env.example
